title: Kerberos Pre-Authentication Disabled
id: b5b59610-23c6-4cf9-9ab8-2d4b3de47f65
status: experimental
description: Detects setting the DONT_REQ_PREAUTH userAccountControl flag on an account (event 4738), which disables Kerberos pre-authentication and deliberately exposes the account to AS-REP roasting.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1558/004/
logsource:
  product: windows
  service: security
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 4738
    AttributeValue|contains: 'DONT_REQ_PREAUTH'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SubjectUserName
  - TargetUserName
  - ObjectName
falsepositives:
  - Legacy accounts intentionally without pre-auth
level: high
tags:
  - attack.credential_access
  - attack.t1558.004
